1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,193
You better wise up, okay?

2
00:00:13,597 --> 00:00:15,110
Hey, Hyeon-wu

3
00:00:15,763 --> 00:00:17,142
Did you get home okay
that day?

4
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:18,580
Yeah

5
00:00:20,422 --> 00:00:21,434
Sit here, Il-tak

6
00:00:22,128 --> 00:00:23,128
Huh?

7
00:00:24,555 --> 00:00:25,555
What's wrong?

8
00:00:25,996 --> 00:00:26,996
You don't want to?

9
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:39,123
Everyone's watching

10
00:00:39,206 --> 00:00:40,374
Who cares?

11
00:00:40,457 --> 00:00:42,208
You wanted
more confidence, right?

12
00:00:42,291 --> 00:00:43,884
Do whatever you want

13
00:00:43,967 --> 00:00:45,427
I'll cover for you

14
00:00:46,081 --> 00:00:47,506
I'll do
whatever I want, too

15
00:00:47,589 --> 00:00:48,757
Still
this doesn't feel right

16
00:00:50,456 --> 00:00:53,625
I knew I'd done
something wrong

17
00:00:55,291 --> 00:00:58,653
but he changed
so drastically

18
00:01:11,951 --> 00:01:12,951
Hey, Hyeong-ju

19
00:01:13,824 --> 00:01:15,659
Where's your friend
Hong Il-tak?

20
00:01:20,218 --> 00:01:21,371
Is it because
of Lee Hyeon-wu?

21
00:01:21,395 --> 00:01:22,395
Hey

22
00:01:22,584 --> 00:01:23,584
Have you lost it?

23
00:01:23,890 --> 00:01:25,544
Do you want
a beating today?

24
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:28,214
I know
how to beat Lee Hyeon-wu

25
00:01:30,085 --> 00:01:32,843
Lim Su-do
a third-year student

26
00:01:35,304 --> 00:01:36,527
can crush
Lee Hyeon-wu
